WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Okay,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.933
a picture puzzle!

00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:13.467
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:14.067
A.

00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:14.633
Top-left,

00:00:14.633 --> 00:00:15.233
B.

00:00:15.233 --> 00:00:15.800
Top-right,

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:16.400
C.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.000
Center,

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.167
or D.

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:18.733
Bottom-left?

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:19.933
Five seconds!

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:26.900
TIME'S UP!

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:29.133
The answer is...

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:29.633
A,

00:00:29.633 --> 00:00:30.167
top-left!

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:32.733
The dot steps clockwise corner

00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:33.800
to corner:

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:34.300
top-right,

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:34.833
bottom-right,

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:35.333
bottom-left,

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:38.433
so the next corner is top-left.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.000
So,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.033
are you smart or fart?

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:44.467
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:45.667
find your rank!

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:47.167
So,

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:48.567
how did you do?

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:49.933
Comment your score below,

00:00:49.933 --> 00:00:51.300
and follow for more!
